                    "value": "<p>The jester blows chalk or face powder in an adjacent enemy's face. The target must make a @Check[fortitude|dc:27|options:inflicts:blinded,inflicts:dazzled,inflicts:off-guard] saving throw.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> target is dazzled and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Blinded] for 1 round.</p>"
